WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.360
The Broadcasts page lists every campaign in your workspace, with its latest delivery totals.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:13.290
Type a name in "Search broadcasts", or narrow the list by number, "All sources", or "All statuses".

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:20.350
Select "Refresh" when a recent campaign is still processing or its delivery totals have changed.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:27.200
Each row shows the recipients as Total, Sent, Delivered, Read, and Failed, with date and status.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:33.870
Select "View Analytics" on any row — and that's it, your campaign details are one click away.
